## Quick Reference Commands

### Development
```powershell
# Start services (CPU mode)
.\make.ps1 up-cpu

# Start services (GPU mode)
.\make.ps1 up-gpu

# Stop services
.\make.ps1 down

# Run backend locally
.\make.ps1 api

# Run frontend locally
.\make.ps1 web

# View logs
.\make.ps1 logs
```

### Testing
```powershell
# Run all tests
pytest tests/ -v --no-cov

# Run specific test file
pytest tests/test_api_analyze.py -v

# Run with coverage
pytest tests/ -v --cov
```

### Code Quality
```powershell
# Format code
.\make.ps1 fmt

# Clean build artifacts
.\make.ps1 clean
```

